.git
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.mp4
*.webm
assets/
site/
data/*
!data/body-annotations.feather
build/*
!build/graph.npz
# mb_sides.json is which dopamine cluster reaches each MBON. It is derived and
# gitignored upstream, and the mushroom body will not build without it - so it
# has to be let through here. mb_gains.npz was learned under the old output
# split and mushroom.py deliberately never reads it, so it does not.
!build/mb_sides.json
# The offline gate's results: the paired-seed screen the room's decision rule
# was certified on, and the two one-sided runs. Nothing reads them at run time
# - they are the evidence for the numbers the site quotes, carried along so
# they can be read inside the container.
!build/backroom_screen.json
!build/backroom_screen_sugar.json
!build/backroom_screen_shock.json
